  "instructions": [
    "Preheat oven to 180°C.",
    "Mix together orange juice, lemon juice, zest, and optional sugar in a bowl. Season with salt and pepper.",
    "Add chopped fennel seeds and unsalted butter into the citrus mixture and stir gently.",
    "Gently fold in eggs if using for added richness.",
    "Heat brass-bowl in oven to warm it evenly (about 3-5 minutes).",
    "Pour citrus mixture into bowl, ensuring edges are covered.",
    "Place the bowl on a baking tray lined with parchment paper to catch any drips.",
    "Bake at 180°C for 12-15 minutes or until set and lightly golden.",
    "Remove from oven and let cool slightly before serving with flaked almonds on top.",
    "Serve warm as dessert or garnish with additional fresh herbs like mint if desired."
  ],
